-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.5 הפסקת עבודה
-- Dismissal in post-primary education: definitions; teachers on a
-- temporary licence; teachers on trial; substitutes; permanent teachers on
-- pedagogical and on disciplinary grounds; criminal or moral offences;
-- religious disqualification; health; and the limits on dismissing a
-- pregnant teacher on trial.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `6.5 הפסקת עבודה`

@desc The parties of section 6.5: the takanon's common ones and the bodies of the dismissal procedure common.l4 does not name.
DECLARE `6.5 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party` HAS `who` IS A Party
    `the head of the division`
    `the supervision committee`
    `the chair of the pedagogical secretariat`
    `the joint committee`
    `the committee of three (section 8(c)(4))`
    `the director of the religious-education division`

DECLARE `dismissal step` IS ONE OF
    `send the decision letter to the owner`
    `send the dismissal letter`
    `send the warning letter`
    `finish the committee's discussion`
    `hold the joint committee's meeting`
    `send the material to the committee members`
    `give notice ending a substitute's work` HAS `days of notice` IS A NUMBER
    `warn the teacher in writing`
    `suspend the teacher`
    `open an internal investigation`
    `notify the owner and the head of the division`
    `apply to the Minister of Labour for a permit`
    `dismiss the pregnant teacher this school year`
    `notify the religious disqualification`

@desc The three office-holders the definition of "head of division" names.
DECLARE `head of division office` IS ONE OF
    `the chair of the committee for post-primary education`
    `the director of the technological-education division`
    `the coordinating supervisor of the settlement-education division`

DECLARE `who acts as "the owner"` IS ONE OF
    `the local authority, through its education department`
    `the principal and/or the owner`

@desc A substitute teacher's engagement (section 6.5.7).
DECLARE `substitute engagement` HAS
    `period fixed in advance`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc engaged for a period defined in advance (not indefinite, not only a maximum)
    `days worked`                   IS A NUMBER
    `days in two months`            IS A NUMBER  @desc how many days two months are, counted from the engagement's start; an input of the calendar

@desc A supervisor's visit to a lesson of a teacher proposed for dismissal (section 6.5.8(b)).
DECLARE `lesson visit` HAS
    `by the second supervisor`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `day of the visit`              IS A NUMBER  @desc the day of the school year the visit was made on
    `full lesson`                   IS A BOOLEAN

-- Time in days from 1 September of the school year (day 0), the year
-- starting in `y`.
GIVEN `day` IS A NUMBER, `month` IS A NUMBER, `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days from 1 September to` `day` `month` `y` IS
    IF `month` AT LEAST 9
    THEN (Date `day` `month` `y`) MINUS (Date 1 9 `y`)
    ELSE (Date `day` `month` (`y` PLUS 1)) MINUS (Date 1 9 `y`)

§§ `Definitions`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p1 The opening words of the definitions ("הגדרות בהוראות אלה").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p2
`the offices that are "head of division"` MEANS
    LIST `the chair of the committee for post-primary education`,
         `the director of the technological-education division`,
         `the coordinating supervisor of the settlement-education division`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p3
GIVEN `a supervisor of the division overseeing post-primary schools` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a member of the supervision committee` `a supervisor of the division overseeing post-primary schools` IF
    `a supervisor of the division overseeing post-primary schools`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p4 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p5
GIVEN `owned by a local authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `who acts as "the owner"`
DECIDE `"the owner" in these rules` `owned by a local authority` IS
    IF `owned by a local authority`
    THEN `the local authority, through its education department`
    ELSE `the principal and/or the owner`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p6
GIVEN `a post-primary institution` IS A BOOLEAN, `under the Ministry's supervision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `"the school" in these rules` `a post-primary institution` `under the Ministry's supervision` IF
    `a post-primary institution` AND `under the Ministry's supervision`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p7
GIVEN `a Ministry supervisor in post-primary education` IS A BOOLEAN, `in charge of the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the general supervisor` `a Ministry supervisor in post-primary education` `in charge of the school` IF
    `a Ministry supervisor in post-primary education` AND `in charge of the school`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p8
GIVEN `found fit by the Ministry to head, coordinate or deputise` IS A BOOLEAN, `appointed by the owner to head a post-primary school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `"the principal" in these rules` `found fit by the Ministry to head, coordinate or deputise` `appointed by the owner to head a post-primary school` IF
    `found fit by the Ministry to head, coordinate or deputise` AND `appointed by the owner to head a post-primary school`

§§ `1–2 פיטורי מורה בעל רישיון הוראה זמני`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2/p9 A heading ("פיטורי מורה בעל רישיון הוראה זמני").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_1/p1
GIVEN `year of work` IS A NUMBER, `at the end of the year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a temporary-licence holder may be dismissed` `year of work` `at the end of the year` IF
    `year of work` AT MOST 3 AND `at the end of the year`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_1/p2
GIVEN `employed a fourth year in the same institution` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be dismissed there for want of a permanent licence` `employed a fourth year in the same institution` IS
    NOT `employed a fourth year in the same institution`

DECLARE `status for dismissal` IS ONE OF
    `as a permanent-licence holder on trial (sections 3-8)`
    `as a permanent teacher (sections 9 and 16)`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_2/p1
GIVEN `year of work` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `status for dismissal`
DECIDE `a temporary-licence holder's status on pedagogical or disciplinary grounds` `year of work` IS
    IF `year of work` AT MOST 3
    THEN `as a permanent-licence holder on trial (sections 3-8)`
    ELSE `as a permanent teacher (sections 9 and 16)`

§§ `3–8 פיטורי מורה בניסיון מטעמים פדגוגיים ומטעמי משמעת`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_2/p2 A heading ("פיטורי מורה בניסיון מטעמים פדגוגיים ומטעמי משמעת").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_3__subpara_a/p1
GIVEN `holds a Ministry teaching licence` IS A BOOLEAN, `tenured in the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher on trial` `holds a Ministry teaching licence` `tenured in the school` IF
    `holds a Ministry teaching licence` AND NOT `tenured in the school`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_3__subpara_a/p2
GIVEN `extended by a year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of a new teacher's trial in a school` `extended by a year` IS
    IF `extended by a year` THEN 3 ELSE 2

-- 3(b): first year, the principal not satisfied (pedagogical, educational,
-- negligence or indiscipline): dismissal on the principal's proposal, by
-- the owner's decision, after consulting the supervision.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_3__subpara_b
GIVEN `first year in the school` IS A BOOLEAN, `the principal proposed it` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `the owner decided it` IS A BOOLEAN, `the supervision was consulted` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a first-year teacher may be dismissed on the principal's proposal` `first year in the school` `the principal proposed it` `the owner decided it` `the supervision was consulted` IF
    `first year in the school` AND `the principal proposed it` AND `the owner decided it` AND `the supervision was consulted`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_4
GIVEN `in the middle of the school year` IS A BOOLEAN, `outside the set procedures` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `goes to the joint committee for expedited decision` `in the middle of the school year` `outside the set procedures` IF
    `in the middle of the school year` AND `outside the set procedures`

DECLARE `outcome of a first-year case` IS ONE OF
    `the work is ended`
    `the head of the division decides`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_5__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_5__subpara_b akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_5__subpara_c
GIVEN `the owner and the principal accepted the supervisor's view` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `outcome of a first-year case`
DECIDE `a first-year case the supervisor raised` `the owner and the principal accepted the supervisor's view` IS
    IF `the owner and the principal accepted the supervisor's view`
    THEN `the work is ended`
    ELSE `the head of the division decides`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_5__subpara_d
GIVEN `notified in writing` IS A BOOLEAN, `full lessons reported` IS A NUMBER,
      `ends in a clear, reasoned proposal` IS A BOOLEAN, `signed by the supervisor's own hand` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supervisor's report is in order` `notified in writing` `full lessons reported` `ends in a clear, reasoned proposal` `signed by the supervisor's own hand` IF
    `notified in writing` AND `full lessons reported` AT LEAST 2 AND `ends in a clear, reasoned proposal` AND `signed by the supervisor's own hand`

-- 5(e) and 6: the head of the division's letter by registered mail by
-- 15 May, then the owner's dismissal letter by 31 May.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_5__subpara_e akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_6
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year the school year starts in
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the first-year dismissal timetable` `y` IS
        (PARTY `the head of the division`
         MUST  `send the decision letter to the owner`
         WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 15 5 `y`
         LEST BREACH BY `the head of the division` BECAUSE "section 6.5.5(e): the decision letter goes by registered mail no later than 15 May")
    RAND
        (PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body`
         MUST  `send the dismissal letter`
         WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 31 5 `y`
         LEST BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 6.5.6: the dismissal letter is sent no later than 31 May")

-- 7: substitutes. F-6.5-a: under two months, 3 days' notice; over two
-- months, two weeks; EXACTLY two months is in neither. The reading adopted
-- gives exactly two months the longer notice.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_7__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_7__subpara_b akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_7__subpara_c
GIVEN e IS A `substitute engagement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days of notice a substitute is owed` e IS
    IF e's `period fixed in advance`
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF e's `days worked` LESS THAN e's `days in two months`
         THEN 3
         ELSE 14

GIVEN e IS A `substitute engagement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a sub-clause of 6.5.7(a)-(b) governs the substitute` e IF
       e's `period fixed in advance`
    OR e's `days worked` LESS THAN e's `days in two months`
    OR e's `days worked` GREATER THAN e's `days in two months`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_7__subpara_d
GIVEN `worked a whole year as a substitute` IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction that year` IS A NUMBER, `invited for the next year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the status of a second trial year` `worked a whole year as a substitute` `position fraction that year` `invited for the next year` IF
    `worked a whole year as a substitute` AND `position fraction that year` AT LEAST 1/3 AND `invited for the next year`

-- 8(a): second year, or third (extended), the principal and/or the
-- supervision not satisfied: dismissal on two supervisors' opinions after
-- the committee of 8(c)(4).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_a
GIVEN `year of the trial` IS A NUMBER, `opinion of the school's supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `opinion of a second supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN, `discussed by the committee of 8(c)(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a second- or third-year teacher may be dismissed` `year of the trial` `opinion of the school's supervisor` `opinion of a second supervisor` `discussed by the committee of 8(c)(4)` IF
        `year of the trial` AT LEAST 2
    AND `year of the trial` AT MOST 3
    AND `opinion of the school's supervisor`
    AND `opinion of a second supervisor`
    AND `discussed by the committee of 8(c)(4)`

-- 8(b): four full-lesson reports, two of them the second supervisor's; no
-- more than 2 lessons of the teacher a day; at least 10 days between one
-- visit and the next; never both supervisors on the same day.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_b
GIVEN vs IS A LIST OF `lesson visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the visits meet section 6.5.8(b)` vs IF
        count (filter (GIVEN v YIELD v's `full lesson`) vs) AT LEAST 4
    AND count (filter (GIVEN v YIELD v's `full lesson` AND v's `by the second supervisor`) vs) AT LEAST 2
    AND all (GIVEN v YIELD count (filter (GIVEN w YIELD w's `day of the visit` EQUALS v's `day of the visit`) vs) AT MOST 2) vs
    AND all (GIVEN v YIELD all (GIVEN w YIELD w's `day of the visit` EQUALS v's `day of the visit`
                                       OR w's `day of the visit` MINUS v's `day of the visit` AT LEAST 10
                                       OR v's `day of the visit` MINUS w's `day of the visit` AT LEAST 10) vs) vs
    AND all (GIVEN v YIELD all (GIVEN w YIELD NOT (w's `day of the visit` EQUALS v's `day of the visit`)
                                       OR w's `by the second supervisor` EQUALS v's `by the second supervisor`) vs) vs

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_3
GIVEN `detailed, not on an ordinary evaluation form` IS A BOOLEAN, `about this school year's work` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `describes and evaluates the lessons` IS A BOOLEAN, `ends in a clear, reasoned recommendation, signed by hand` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supervisors' reports are in order` `detailed, not on an ordinary evaluation form` `about this school year's work` `describes and evaluates the lessons` `ends in a clear, reasoned recommendation, signed by hand` IF
    `detailed, not on an ordinary evaluation form` AND `about this school year's work` AND `describes and evaluates the lessons` AND `ends in a clear, reasoned recommendation, signed by hand`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_4
GIVEN `chaired by the head of the division` IS A BOOLEAN, `other supervisors of the division` IS A NUMBER,
      `members who visited the teacher's lessons in the last year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee of three is properly made up` `chaired by the head of the division` `other supervisors of the division` `members who visited the teacher's lessons in the last year` IF
    `chaired by the head of the division` AND `other supervisors of the division` EQUALS 2 AND `members who visited the teacher's lessons in the last year` EQUALS 0

-- 8(c)(5): a dismissal decided goes as in 5(e) and 6 —
-- `the first-year dismissal timetable`.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_5
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `carrying out the committee's dismissal` `y` IS `the first-year dismissal timetable` `y`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_6/p1
GIVEN `year of the trial` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee may give a further trial year` `year of the trial` IF
    `year of the trial` EQUALS 2

§§ `9–15 פיטורי מורה קבוע מטעמים פדגוגיים`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_8__subpara_c__cls_6/p2 A heading ("פיטורי מורה קבוע מטעמים פדגוגיים").

-- 9: on a detailed report (never an ordinary evaluation form), the
-- supervision committee finishes within two weeks of receiving it. Time in
-- days from the report's receipt.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_9
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the supervision committee's two weeks` IS
    PARTY `the supervision committee`
    MUST  `finish the committee's discussion`
    WITHIN 14
    LEST BREACH BY `the supervision committee` BECAUSE "section 6.5.9: the committee ends its discussion within two weeks of receiving the report"

-- 10-11: the committee's reasoned conclusions to the owner in a letter of
-- set form (copy to the secretariat's chair); the owner's warning letter to
-- the teacher within two weeks of receiving them (days from receipt).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_10 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_11
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the warning letter` IS
    PARTY `the head of the division`
    MUST  `send the decision letter to the owner`
    HENCE (PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body`
           MUST  `send the warning letter`
           WITHIN 14
           LEST BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 6.5.11: the warning letter goes out within two weeks of the notice")

-- 12(a): no improvement in the next school year — the general supervisor
-- may propose dismissal to the supervision committee, acting under 8(b) and
-- 8(c)(1)-(3), but with three supervisors of two lessons each. 12(b): a
-- warning of the joint committee (15(c)) followed by no change — under 8(b)
-- and 8(c)(1)-(3) as they stand.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_12__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_12__subpara_b
GIVEN `warned by the joint committee rather than the supervision committee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supervisors who visit, two lessons each` `warned by the joint committee rather than the supervision committee` IS
    IF `warned by the joint committee rather than the supervision committee` THEN 2 ELSE 3

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_12__subpara_a
GIVEN `the work improved in the following year` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `the general supervisor's initiative` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `the principal's or owner's proposal with the supervisor's consent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `dismissal of a warned permanent teacher may be proposed` `the work improved in the following year` `the general supervisor's initiative` `the principal's or owner's proposal with the supervisor's consent` IF
    NOT `the work improved in the following year`
    AND (`the general supervisor's initiative` OR `the principal's or owner's proposal with the supervisor's consent`)

-- F-6.5-c: 12(a) sends the proposal to "the supervision committee" (all the
-- division's supervisors); 13 has it decided by "the committee on behalf of
-- the supervision (see 8(c)(4))" — the committee of three, whose members
-- may not have visited the teacher's lessons that year. The reading
-- adopted: the committee of three decides, as 13 names it by reference.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_13
GIVETH A `6.5 party`
DECIDE `the body that decides to propose a permanent teacher's dismissal` IS `the committee of three (section 8(c)(4))`

-- 14: the secretariat's chair appoints two (one chairing), and the owner and
-- the representative organisation up to two each; the material goes out
-- about two weeks before; the meeting no later than 1 May.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_14
GIVEN `the secretariat's members (chair included)` IS A NUMBER, `the owner's members` IS A NUMBER, `the organisation's members` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the joint committee is properly made up` `the secretariat's members (chair included)` `the owner's members` `the organisation's members` IF
    `the secretariat's members (chair included)` EQUALS 2 AND `the owner's members` AT MOST 2 AND `the organisation's members` AT MOST 2

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_14
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the joint committee's meeting` `y` IS
    PARTY `the chair of the pedagogical secretariat`
    MUST  `hold the joint committee's meeting`
    WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 1 5 `y`
    LEST BREACH BY `the chair of the pedagogical secretariat` BECAUSE "section 6.5.14: the joint committee meets no later than 1 May"

-- 15(a)-(b) (and 21(d)(1)-(2) for disciplinary cases): a dismissal decided
-- reaches the secretariat's chair, who tells the principal and/or owner,
-- who notify the teacher and carry it out at once, by 31 May.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_15__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_15__subpara_b akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_2/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_2/p2
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `carrying out the joint committee's dismissal` `y` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the dismissal letter`
    WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 31 5 `y`
    LEST BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "sections 6.5.15(b) and 6.5.21(d)(2): the dismissal is carried out at once and no later than 31 May"

-- 15(c) and 21(d)(3): the joint committee may warn instead, once only (on
-- the same matter); a warning about a year the teacher did not teach
-- (unpaid leave, maternity leave and the like) applies to the next year.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_15__subpara_c akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_3
GIVEN `warnings already given on the matter` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the joint committee may warn` `warnings already given on the matter` IF
    `warnings already given on the matter` EQUALS 0

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_15__subpara_c akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_3
GIVEN `the year warned about` IS A NUMBER, `taught in that year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the year the warning applies to` `the year warned about` `taught in that year` IS
    IF `taught in that year` THEN `the year warned about` ELSE `the year warned about` PLUS 1

-- 15(d) and 21(d)(4): a unanimous decision is final. F-6.5-b: what becomes
-- of a decision taken by a majority is not said.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_15__subpara_d/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_4/p1
GIVEN `taken unanimously` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the joint committee's decision is final` `taken unanimously` IF `taken unanimously`

§§ `16–21 פיטורי מורה קבוע מטעמי משמעת`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_15__subpara_d/p2 A heading ("פיטורי מורה קבוע מטעמי משמעת").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_16
GIVEN `negligence or a disciplinary offence, in the view of the supervisor, owner or principal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the principal's written warning` `negligence or a disciplinary offence, in the view of the supervisor, owner or principal` IS
    IF `negligence or a disciplinary offence, in the view of the supervisor, owner or principal`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal` MUST `warn the teacher in writing`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 17: the warned teacher may submit a defence; the supervisor, owner and
-- principal hear it; the decision goes to the teacher through the
-- principal. 19: the same, one level up, for a reprimand: a defence to the
-- head of the division, who clears it with the owner, and the secretariat's
-- chair decides a disagreement between them.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_17/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_17/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_19
GIVEN `a reprimand rather than a warning` IS A BOOLEAN, `the head of the division and the owner disagree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `6.5 party`
DECIDE `who decides on the teacher's defence` `a reprimand rather than a warning` `the head of the division and the owner disagree` IS
    IF NOT `a reprimand rather than a warning`
    THEN `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    ELSE IF `the head of the division and the owner disagree`
         THEN `the chair of the pedagogical secretariat`
         ELSE `the head of the division`

-- 18 and 20: a repeated offence within five years of a warning brings a
-- reprimand; within five years of a reprimand, dismissal proceedings
-- (21) through the general supervisor.
DECLARE `consequence of a repeated offence` IS ONE OF
    `a reprimand worded as a warning of dismissal`
    `dismissal proceedings through the general supervisor`
    `no step under sections 18 and 20`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_18/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_18/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_20
GIVEN `holds a written reprimand` IS A BOOLEAN, `holds a written warning` IS A BOOLEAN, `years since it` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `consequence of a repeated offence`
DECIDE `a repeated offence leads to` `holds a written reprimand` `holds a written warning` `years since it` IS
    IF `years since it` GREATER THAN 5
    THEN `no step under sections 18 and 20`
    ELSE IF `holds a written reprimand`
         THEN `dismissal proceedings through the general supervisor`
         ELSE IF `holds a written warning`
              THEN `a reprimand worded as a warning of dismissal`
              ELSE `no step under sections 18 and 20`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_b akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_c/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_c/p2
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the disciplinary joint committee` `y` IS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `finish the committee's discussion`
    WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 1 5 `y`
    LEST BREACH BY `the joint committee` BECAUSE "section 6.5.21(c): the joint committee's discussions end no later than 1 May"

§§ `22–24 פיטורין בגלל עבירה פלילית או מוסרית`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_21__subpara_d__cls_4/p2 A heading ("פיטורין בגלל עבירה פלילית או מוסרית").

-- 22: on a complaint or well-founded information of a criminal or moral
-- offence, no inquiry of their own: the principal or general supervisor
-- tells the owner and the head of the division at once.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `a complaint of a criminal or moral offence` IS
    (PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal` SHANT `open an internal investigation`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
     MUST  `notify the owner and the head of the division`
     WITHIN 0)

-- 22(a)-(d): any one of four grounds makes the secretariat's chair and the
-- owner suspend the teacher until the inquiry ends; pay and rights during
-- the suspension are a suspended state employee's under the תקשי"ר (an
-- input); every such case is kept in absolute confidence.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p3 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p4 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p5 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p6 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p7 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p8 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p9 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p10
GIVEN `serious suspicion of embezzlement or knowing abuse of office` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `malicious breach of discipline` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `charged in court with a criminal offence of moral turpitude` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `disloyalty to the State, its tasks or the Jewish people, at school or among pupils` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher is suspended until the inquiry ends` `serious suspicion of embezzlement or knowing abuse of office` `malicious breach of discipline` `charged in court with a criminal offence of moral turpitude` `disloyalty to the State, its tasks or the Jewish people, at school or among pupils` IF
       `serious suspicion of embezzlement or knowing abuse of office`
    OR `malicious breach of discipline`
    OR `charged in court with a criminal offence of moral turpitude`
    OR `disloyalty to the State, its tasks or the Jewish people, at school or among pupils`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p11
GIVEN `a suspended state employee's pay under the תקשי"ר` IS A NUMBER @desc pay of a suspended state employee as the civil-service regulations set it; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay during the suspension` `a suspended state employee's pay under the תקשי"ר` IS
    `a suspended state employee's pay under the תקשי"ר`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_22__subpara_a/p12
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every such case is kept in absolute confidence` IS TRUE

DECLARE `route of a suspected offence` IS ONE OF
    `to the police`
    `to the division, then a joint committee (sections 10 and 14)`
    `no further step`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_23__subpara_a
GIVEN `well-founded suspicion of a criminal act` IS A BOOLEAN, `the act does not befit the teacher's standing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `route of a suspected offence`
DECIDE `where the case goes` `well-founded suspicion of a criminal act` `the act does not befit the teacher's standing` IS
    IF `well-founded suspicion of a criminal act`
    THEN `to the police`
    ELSE IF `the act does not befit the teacher's standing`
         THEN `to the division, then a joint committee (sections 10 and 14)`
         ELSE `no further step`

-- 23(b): convicted, the teacher may be dismissed at once; an appeal does
-- not delay it; acquitted on appeal, the continuation goes to the joint
-- committee.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_23__subpara_b/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_23__subpara_b/p2
GIVEN `convicted` IS A BOOLEAN, `acquitted on appeal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be dismissed at once` `convicted` `acquitted on appeal` IF
    `convicted` AND NOT `acquitted on appeal`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_24__subpara_a
GIVEN `a teacher on trial` IS A BOOLEAN, `at the end of the school year` IS A BOOLEAN, `the offence demands dismissal mid-year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a joint committee is needed` `a teacher on trial` `at the end of the school year` `the offence demands dismissal mid-year` IF
    NOT (`a teacher on trial` AND `at the end of the school year`) OR `the offence demands dismissal mid-year`

-- 24(b): a teacher on trial dismissed at the year's end for such an
-- offence — as in 5(e) and 6.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_24__subpara_b/p1
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `end-of-year dismissal for an offence` `y` IS `the first-year dismissal timetable` `y`

§§ `25–26 פיטורין על-פי פסילה מטעמים דתיים`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_24__subpara_b/p2 A heading ("פיטורין על-פי פסילה מטעמים דתיים").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_25/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_25/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_26/p1
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `a religious disqualification` `y` IS
        (PARTY `the director of the religious-education division`
         MUST  `notify the religious disqualification`
         WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 15 5 `y`
         LEST BREACH BY `the director of the religious-education division` BECAUSE "section 6.5.25: the notice reaches the owner by registered mail no later than 15 May")
    RAND
        (PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body`
         MUST  `send the dismissal letter`
         WITHIN `days from 1 September to` 31 5 `y`
         LEST BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 6.5.26: the dismissal letter from that institution goes out no later than 31 May")

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_26/p2
GIVEN `held a permanent licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supervision must try to place the teacher in another school` `held a permanent licence` IF
    `held a permanent licence`

§§ `27 פיטורין מטעמי בריאות`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_26/p3 A heading ("פיטורין מטעמי בריאות").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_a__cls_2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_a__cls_3
GIVEN `a doctor proposed by the owner` IS A BOOLEAN, `a doctor proposed by the teachers' representatives` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `a doctor chosen by the first two` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the doctors' committee is properly made up` `a doctor proposed by the owner` `a doctor proposed by the teachers' representatives` `a doctor chosen by the first two` IF
    `a doctor proposed by the owner` AND `a doctor proposed by the teachers' representatives` AND `a doctor chosen by the first two`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b/p1
GIVEN `members demanding an examination` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher must submit to examination` `members demanding an examination` IF
    `members demanding an examination` AT LEAST 2

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b/p2 A heading ("הגבלת פיטורין", limits on dismissal).

-- The pregnant teacher on trial, in an owner's power to dismiss: the joint
-- committee's conclusions (¶3) in (a)-(e).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b/p3
GIVEN `pregnant` IS A BOOLEAN, `on trial in post-primary education` IS A BOOLEAN, `the owner may dismiss her` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the limits on dismissal apply` `pregnant` `on trial in post-primary education` `the owner may dismiss her` IF
    `pregnant` AND `on trial in post-primary education` AND `the owner may dismiss her`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_a A pure pointer: the wording of the law is quoted in section 1.28.2.1, encoded there.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_b
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last day to give notice of dismissal` `y` IS `days from 1 September to` 31 5 `y`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_b
GIVEN `y` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the day a dismissal takes effect` `y` IS Date 1 9 (`y` PLUS 1)

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c/p2
`the parity committee for a pregnant teacher` MEANS
    LIST
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_1 (1) the Teachers' Union.
        "representatives of the Teachers' Union",
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_2 (2) the Secondary School Teachers' Association.
        "representatives of the Secondary School Teachers' Association",
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_3 (3) the Ministry of Education.
        "representatives of the Ministry of Education",
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_4 (4) the Centre for Local Government.
        "representatives of the Centre for Local Government",
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_5 (5) the owner of the post-primary institution.
        "representatives of the owner of the institution",
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_6 (6) the school's principal.
        "the school's principal",
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c__pnt_7 (7) in some cases, the school's supervisor too.
        "in some cases, the school's supervisor"

-- (c)-(d): no application to the Minister of Labour under section 9(b) of
-- the Women's Work Law before the parity committee heard the case — also
-- where the owner did not know of the pregnancy and the teacher objected
-- between the notice and its taking effect.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_c/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_d
GIVEN `the parity committee heard the case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `applying to the Minister of Labour` `the parity committee heard the case` IS
    IF `the parity committee heard the case`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` MAY   `apply to the Minister of Labour for a permit`
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` SHANT `apply to the Minister of Labour for a permit`

-- (e): the committee hears the cases of (c) and (d). Its conclusion to
-- dismiss is attached to the application; its conclusion not to dismiss
-- keeps her that school year, and the next counts as a further trial year.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_e/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_e/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_e/p3
GIVEN `the committee concluded she should not be dismissed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.5 party` `dismissal step`
DECIDE `the parity committee's conclusion` `the committee concluded she should not be dismissed` IS
    IF `the committee concluded she should not be dismissed`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` SHANT `dismiss the pregnant teacher this school year`
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` MAY `apply to the Minister of Labour for a permit`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_2__para_27__subpara_b__cls_e/p3
GIVEN `the committee concluded she should not be dismissed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the next school year is a further trial year` `the committee concluded she should not be dismissed` IF
    `the committee concluded she should not be dismissed`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_3__para_1 Source (אסמכתא): the procedure is the practice of post-primary education.
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_5__hc_3__para_2 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular and section 9 of the Women's Work Law, 1954, with its amendments.

-- Examples.
#ASSERT `days from 1 September to` 15 5 2026 EQUALS 256
#ASSERT `a repeated offence leads to` FALSE TRUE 3 EQUALS `a reprimand worded as a warning of dismissal`
#ASSERT `the visits meet section 6.5.8(b)` (LIST `lesson visit` FALSE 10 TRUE, `lesson visit` FALSE 10 TRUE, `lesson visit` TRUE 30 TRUE, `lesson visit` TRUE 45 TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the visits meet section 6.5.8(b)` (LIST `lesson visit` FALSE 10 TRUE, `lesson visit` TRUE 10 TRUE, `lesson visit` TRUE 30 TRUE, `lesson visit` FALSE 45 TRUE)

-- The 2026/27 timetable: decision letter on 10 May (day 251), dismissal
-- letter on 3 June (day 275) — late.
#TRACE `the first-year dismissal timetable` 2026 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the head of the division` DOES `send the decision letter to the owner` AT 251
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` DOES `send the dismissal letter` AT 275
#TRACE `the warning letter` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the head of the division` DOES `send the decision letter to the owner` AT 0
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the local authority or owning body` DOES `send the warning letter` AT 10

-- F-6.5-a: a substitute who has worked exactly two months is under neither
-- sub-clause.
`a substitute of exactly two months is under neither sub-clause` MEANS
    NOT `a sub-clause of 6.5.7(a)-(b) governs the substitute` (`substitute engagement` WITH `period fixed in advance` IS FALSE, `days worked` IS 61, `days in two months` IS 61)
#ASSERT `a substitute of exactly two months is under neither sub-clause`

-- F-6.5-b: only a unanimous decision is declared final; a majority
-- decision's fate is not said.
`a majority decision of the joint committee is not declared final` MEANS
    NOT `the joint committee's decision is final` FALSE
#ASSERT `a majority decision of the joint committee is not declared final`

-- F-6.5-c: section 12(a)'s "supervision committee" (every supervisor of the
-- division) and section 13's committee of 8(c)(4) (the head and two
-- supervisors who did not visit) are two different bodies.
-- A supervisor of the division who visited the teacher under 12(a) sits on
-- the first and may not sit on the second.
`a visiting supervisor sits on one committee and not the other` MEANS
        `a member of the supervision committee` TRUE
    AND NOT `the committee of three is properly made up` TRUE 2 1
#ASSERT `a visiting supervisor sits on one committee and not the other`
